      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.74,
      "end_seconds": 4.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.0,
      "end_seconds": 9.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 9.76,
      "end_seconds": 16.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "doctor, um, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.13,
      "end_seconds": 21.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.32,
      "end_seconds": 29.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "it's a chronic cough with lots of phlegm, mostly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.73,
      "end_seconds": 35.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.2,
      "end_seconds": 41.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Five days I think... sorry three days I got that wrong"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.0,
      "end_seconds": 51.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.31,
      "end_seconds": 57.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Mostly severe. It settles a little with chest physio."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.12,
      "end_seconds": 64.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "what about tiredness, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.26,
      "end_seconds": 84.36,
      "duration_seconds": 18.1,
      "text": "yes, I have as for getting out of breath, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before oh, uh, I had green phlegm lately before that's settled now, though"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.72,
      "end_seconds": 89.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Have you had any coughing up blood or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.25,
      "end_seconds": 97.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "no, no coughing up blood or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.02,
      "end_seconds": 103.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "have you had any chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.66,
      "end_seconds": 107.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "No um not a a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.99,
      "end_seconds": 111.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I follow. And your skin any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.69,
      "end_seconds": 118.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "uh no skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.65,
      "end_seconds": 135.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.56,
      "end_seconds": 140.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Just a a varicose vein procedure, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.59,
      "end_seconds": 152.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "is there anything relevant on the the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.82,
      "end_seconds": 159.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "my daughter has type 1 diabetes my mother had a stroke"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.77,
      "end_seconds": 162.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.74,
      "end_seconds": 170.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "No nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.47,
      "end_seconds": 175.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.21,
      "end_seconds": 184.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.98,
      "text": "I have gout, for two years. I, I have anxiety, for nearly five years. Yes, eczema"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.17,
      "end_seconds": 195.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.85,
      "text": "Alright, anxiety, that matches what I have here. Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.31,
      "end_seconds": 214.95,
      "duration_seconds": 18.64,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. My partner and our baby. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.55,
      "end_seconds": 218.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.04,
      "end_seconds": 222.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Febuxostat, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.21,
      "end_seconds": 225.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "So how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.98,
      "end_seconds": 234.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "80 milligrams i'm on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, maybe, once a day for the anxiety"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.1,
      "end_seconds": 241.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.96,
      "end_seconds": 251.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "hmm not with me i'll bring it it next time i'm on hydrocortisone cream when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.17,
      "end_seconds": 254.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.66,
      "end_seconds": 267.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "So, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.7,
      "end_seconds": 292.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "okay: BP is 121 over 75, respiratory rate 17, heart rate 86, SpO2 98 percent on room air"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.19,
      "end_seconds": 295.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Is that that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.35,
      "end_seconds": 300.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.2,
      "end_seconds": 305.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "let me look at the area I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.48,
      "end_seconds": 310.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.95,
      "end_seconds": 331.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "there are coarse crackles at both bases and the fingers are slightly clubbed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.96,
      "end_seconds": 334.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.9,
      "end_seconds": 351.83,
      "duration_seconds": 12.93,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with a flare of bronchiectasis. A chest infection is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.19,
      "end_seconds": 364.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Let's book a chest X-ray to to look into bronchiectasis flare."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.71,
      "end_seconds": 368.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "So So how long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.33,
      "end_seconds": 391.41,
      "duration_seconds": 21.08,
      "text": "I'm going to order a sputum culture, for purulent sputum for this, clarithromycin, 500 milligrams, twice a day, fourteen days you take it by mouth it's for bronchiectasis flare keep up your airway clearance exercises twice a day let's get you seen by the respiratory clinic, I'll arrange the letter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.13,
      "end_seconds": 397.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Okay, so sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.93,
      "end_seconds": 424.38,
      "duration_seconds": 26.45,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. I'd like to see you again in two weeks. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 429.2,
      "end_seconds": 431.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "that's clear, um, thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 432.87,
      "end_seconds": 434.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}